          "value": "<p>The Abomination moves up to its speed, flowing into the spaces of creatures its size or smaller. Each rolls an Evasion check vs DC 18: success — pushed 1 square aside; fail — engulfed: 2d6 chemical damage, Blinded and Restrained inside it, and 2d6 chemical at the start of each of the Abomination's turns. Escape: Violence check vs DC 18, exiting prone in an adjacent square, filmed in ichor.</p>",
